fix:
Encapsulate the business rule strictly inside the domain receiver and let the function return a `Result` indicating success or failure.
```rust
impl Voyage {
    fn make_booking(&mut self, cargo: Cargo) -> Result<(), BookingError> {
        if cargo.size + self.booked_cargo_size() > (self.capacity() * 1.1) {
            return Err(BookingError::Overbooked);
        }
        self.add_cargo(cargo);
        Ok(())
    }
}
```
